  - m_Id: 695547693871105
    m_Localized: 'The shop is very neat.

      I enjoyed looking around.

      I''ll
      buy this one.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871106
    m_Localized: 'Hmm, just what I was looking for.

      The quality looks fine.

      Checkout,
      please.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871107
    m_Localized: 'First time visiting this shop.

      I should come by often.

      I''ll
      take this, please.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871108
    m_Localized: 'I was looking for a gift for a friend.

      This is exactly what
      I wanted.

      I''ll pay for this.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871109
    m_Localized: 'I just ran out of this at home.

      I''m glad you have it in
      stock.

      Checkout, please.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871110
    m_Localized: 'All the items look good.

      I had a hard time choosing, but
      I''ll take this.

      Here is the money.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871111
    m_Localized: 'Excuse me, this is too expensive.

      Can''t you give me a little
      discount?

      I''ll be a regular, please?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871112
    m_Localized: 'Hey, I know the original price.

      This much should be enough,
      right?

      Let''s make it cheap.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871113
    m_Localized: 'I like the item.

      But the price is a bit disappointing.

      Please
      lower it a bit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871114
    m_Localized: 'It was cheaper at other shops.

      I''ll buy it here, so give
      me a discount.

      I''m counting on your sense, boss.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871115
    m_Localized: 'Ah, this is taking forever.

      Hurry up and ring me up.

      I''m
      busy, you know.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871116
    m_Localized: 'What are you doing not checking me out?

      Let''s get this
      done quickly.

      I''m dying of waiting.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871117
    m_Localized: 'Why are your movements so slow?

      Give me this quickly.

      I
      don''t have time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871118
    m_Localized: 'Excuse me, can you check me out first?

      I have an urgent
      matter.

      Hurry, hurry!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871119
    m_Localized: 'Hello, boss.

      I don''t have a single penny right now.

      Could
      you just give this to me?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871120
    m_Localized: 'I really want to buy this.

      But I have no money on me.

      Just
      think of it as charity and give me one.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871121
    m_Localized: 'I haven''t eaten anything for days.

      Can I take this?

      I
      will definitely pay you back later.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871122
    m_Localized: 'I wanted it so much while looking around.

      But I didn''t
      bring my wallet.

      Can''t you give it to me for free?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871123
    m_Localized: 'Hello, the weather is really nice.

      I''m in a good mood,
      keep the change.

      Keep up the good work!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871124
    m_Localized: 'I love the item so much.

      This is a small token of my appreciation.

      You
      don''t have to give me change.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695547693871125
    m_Localized: 'You are very kind, boss.

      I''ll give you the rest as a tip.

      May
      your business prosper.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 735560012701696
